  "title": "Jenny&#39;s Cuban-Style Slow-Cooker Chicken Fricassee",
  "description": "Fifteen minutes in the morning are all you need devote to enjoy a delicious Cuban chicken fricassee in the evening. This dish combines chicken legs, potatoes, onions, garlic, and green peppers with tomato sauce, white wine, cumin, and sage.",
